f
GR
GS
[0.12 0 0 0.12 0 322.56003] CT
[1 0 0 1 0 0] CT
N
0 -2688 M
7593.999 -2688 L
7593.999 512 L
0 512 L
0 -2688 L
cp
clip
GS
0 0 translate
1215 512 scale
